<title>UK: Deutsche Schiffsbank has 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Schiffsbank has 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE SCHIFFSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.00	MATURITY   *12.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.97     PAY DATE    12.JUN.97</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  LISTING    BREMEN    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES     *PAYS 4.9 PERCENT FROM 12.DEC.97 IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>-- LOndon newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
